{"body":[{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29886_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"p","x":"LAS VEGAS, USA (AVING Special Report on 'CES 2007') -- <Visual News> AURORA presented its 15 sheets micro-shred shredder ''AS1540CD'' during CES 2007. It can shred CD/DVD and credit cards as well as papers. It also has 13.2 gal-size pull out basket, overload protection and LED status indicator light."},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29887_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29888_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29889_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29890_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29891_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29892_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29893_4413.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29894_4414.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200702/6898_29895_4414.jpg","cap":""}]}